        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(gateway): make hot reload transactional",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nHot reload could expose a mixed gateway generation when channel reload was deferred: config and secret state could advance while channel/runtime subsystems still represented the prior generation. Shutdown could also race an in-flight reload transaction.\n\nFixes #103736. Replaces #103880 because GitHub rejected maintainer writes to its fork branch and the repo-native GraphQL fallback cannot safely publish the 4,551-file rebase delta.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThe gateway now stages reload work as one transaction, publishes config, secrets, auth snapshots, and subsystem state at the activation edge, and drains admitted reload work before teardown. The replacement commit preserves the reviewed tree from #103880, rebased onto current `main`, with contributor credit for @LZY3538.\n\n## User Impact\n\nVercel and other long-lived gateway hosts can reload configuration without observing partially advanced runtime state. Failed or cancelled reloads retain the prior coherent generation, while shutdown waits for admitted reload work to finish.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Final head: `e24aa321267bbc7653926493f5ac406aca97e57c`. Relative to the fully proved code head `9174b447372f5426df85e7d24d016808df3ee2a7`, it removes the release-owned root changelog entry and fixes the CI-revealed restart-emission self-count.\n- Blacksmith Testbox `tbx_01kxccrq7t981qv7te8c163ydk`: focused reload, restart, auth DB, config, secrets, and gateway surface, 748/748 tests passed.\n- Same Testbox: path-scoped `pnpm check:changed` passed in 11m31s, including formatting, conflict scan, changelog attribution, SDK baseline, core and test typechecks, core and script lint, database/storage guards, and runtime import-cycle checks.\n- Same Testbox: `pnpm plugin-sdk:surface:check` passed with zero forbidden package-exported subpaths.\n- Blacksmith Testbox `tbx_01kxcfmf82307j1hay6m1fr2a5`: the two failed CI files plus restart/infra invariants passed 81/81; a two-file `pnpm check:changed` passed in 3m16s; fresh autoreview reported no actionable findings.\n- Fresh `autoreview --mode uncommitted` passed with no accepted or actionable findings after whole-function review.\n- `git diff --check` passed.\n\nAgent transcript omitted because publication was not approved.\n",
